model lis
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-15
  start 2021-01-01
  end 2035-12-31
  note "Household A, the Lis family of Dębowo (tmp/cases/A/story.md): Ania (Anna) and Tomek (Tomasz), married 2016-09-10 without a marriage contract, and Zosia (Zofia), born 2023-04-27. Amounts are in DUK, the dukat of Lenia, of 100 orts."
  note "The reality is this directory and the law parts of cases/law/ it reads: GEN-1, GEN-3, GEN-5, GEN-6, PIT-2 to PIT-9, SOC-1, SOC-2, SOC-8, FAM-1, WCP-1, WCP-2, CIV-1, IGT-1 to IGT-4, CC-1, CC-2, MOT-1, MOT-2."
  note "The record files the questions read are observations (statements/statements.tally, L §5.19): the joint account's statements 2024-08 to 2025-12, the wrapped account's register and both Rzeka registers, each row citing its file and line; the Wektor registers, the Lazur export and Ania's savings export are read only by their balances (records.tally). The importer's dialect isn't part of tally 2 (O:A-1)."

